1
00:00:00,040 --> 00:00:12,239
And then I will just brush out my hair.
接着，我就梳一梳头发。

2
00:00:12,239 --> 00:00:14,200
Then of course I'm going to pop on my watch.
然后，我当然还会戴上手表。

3
00:00:14,200 --> 00:00:21,320
I'm a bit of a compulsive watch checker, um, which isn't fantastic, but I definitely miss it when I'm not wearing my watch.
我有点忍不住老看表，嗯，这不算什么好习惯，但不戴表的时候我确实会不习惯。

4
00:00:21,320 --> 00:00:22,959
I'll fill up my water bottle as well.
我还会把水瓶灌满。

5
00:00:22,959 --> 00:00:29,399
And every single time I try and fill up my chili's water bottle at the to before real realizing that it just won't fit.
每次想在水龙头那里灌水，我都会又一次发现，这个水瓶根本放不进去。

6
00:00:29,399 --> 00:00:33,109
So instead I grab another container and use that to fill it up.
所以我会换拿另一个容器，用它来把水瓶灌满。

7
00:00:33,119 --> 00:00:43,440
Water is honestly my biggest study essential, and it's so important to have a bottle of water on you when you're going to a class, especially when it's a 2 hour class because you will get dehydrated.
说真的，水是我学习时最离不开的东西。去上课时随身带瓶水很重要，尤其是一节两小时的课，不然会很缺水。

8
00:00:43,440 --> 00:00:44,640
Then I will pack my bag.
接着，我会收拾书包。

9
00:00:44,640 --> 00:00:55,959
It's already semi packed from the night before, but I'll put, but I'll just put in my book, my water bottle, um, and check that I've got I need.
前一天晚上已经收拾了一部分，不过我还是会再放进书和水瓶，嗯，检查需要带的东西是不是都带了。

10
00:00:55,959 --> 00:01:01,079
The temperature is also dropped here in the UK, so I will put on my coat and scarf.
英国这边气温也降了，所以我会穿上外套、戴上围巾。

11
00:01:01,079 --> 00:01:05,840
Um, last week I was not having to wear a coat, but coat season is definitely here.
嗯，上周还不用穿外套，但现在确实到了穿外套的季节。

12
00:01:05,840 --> 00:01:13,710
And I also grab my ID and university card because, um, that's what lets me in and out of my building.
我还会拿上身份证件和校园卡，因为进出宿舍楼要用它们。

13
00:01:13,720 --> 00:01:15,789
And it's what lets me into the libraries.
进图书馆也要用到它。

14
00:01:15,799 --> 00:01:26,399
I definitely cannot leave without this.
这个我可绝对不能忘带。

15
00:01:28,959 --> 00:01:30,440
And then I will just head out.
然后，我就出门了。

16
00:01:30,440 --> 00:01:35,679
Today I bumped into someone on my floor.
今天我碰到了一个住在同一层的人。

17
00:01:35,679 --> 00:01:40,150
First thing I will actually do when I've left college is go to Pret.
离开学院之后，我实际做的第一件事是去 Pret。

18
00:01:40,160 --> 00:01:41,949
Yes, I know, I got a Pret subscription.
是的，我知道，我办了 Pret 的订阅。

19
00:01:41,959 --> 00:01:44,399
Genuinely though, I don't regret it in the slightest.
不过说真的，我一点也不后悔。

20
00:01:44,399 --> 00:01:46,600
And I'm so glad that I got it.
我很高兴自己办了它。

21
00:01:46,600 --> 00:01:48,760
I just didn't really want to buy a coffee machine.
我其实就是不太想买咖啡机。

22
00:01:48,760 --> 00:01:51,799
And so I've just been getting all of my coffees from Pret instead.
所以，我最近就一直改在 Pret 买咖啡了。

23
00:01:51,799 --> 00:01:55,200
And it feels like it makes a lot of sense.
感觉这样安排还挺合理的。

24
00:01:55,200 --> 00:01:57,639
And I'm justifying to myself all the time.
而且我一直在说服自己这样做有道理。

25
00:01:57,639 --> 00:02:01,280
It also brings me so much joy being able to go into Pret and just get any drink.
能走进 Pret 随便选一杯喝的，也会让我很开心。

26
00:02:01,280 --> 00:02:05,439
As I say, I had 9:00 a.m. class today, so I walked to the English faculty.
正如刚才说的，今天我早上九点有课，所以我走去了英语系。

27
00:02:05,439 --> 00:02:26,280
And honestly I just can't get over the fact that this is my daily walk, that every single day I get to walk past the Radcliffe Camera and all of this stunning gorgeous architecture, and I just feel so tremendously grateful to be here.
说真的，我还是会惊叹：这竟然是我每天走的路，每天都能经过拉德克利夫阅览室和这些惊艳的建筑。我能在这里，真的觉得非常感恩。

28
00:02:42,240 --> 00:02:44,280
Then this is me in my class.
接下来，这是我上课的时候。

29
00:02:44,280 --> 00:02:47,520
It was a transcription class that I had today.
今天我上的是一节转写课。

30
00:02:47,520 --> 00:02:49,120
Um, and this class is honestly so fun.
嗯，这门课真的很有趣。

31
00:02:49,120 --> 00:02:51,160
Our professor is fantastic.
我们的教授非常棒。

32
00:02:51,200 --> 00:02:56,720
Usually as well, when I get back to college, the first thing I would do is check my pigeon hole for letters.
通常，回到学院之后，我也会先看看自己的信件格里有没有信。

33
00:02:56,720 --> 00:02:58,480
And today I did have two.
今天还真有两封。

34
00:02:58,480 --> 00:03:05,360
My mom had sent me a card and also this pack of limited edition Harry Potter stamps, which was so thoughtful of her.
妈妈寄来了一张卡片，还有这包哈利·波特限量版邮票，真的很贴心。

35
00:03:05,360 --> 00:03:10,360
I didn't realize she was going to do that, and it definitely put a smile on my face.
我没想到她会这样做，这真的让我笑了出来。

36
00:03:10,360 --> 00:03:13,800
Um, but that brings me to the end of today's video.
嗯，那今天的视频就到这里啦。

37
00:03:13,800 --> 00:03:18,390
My mornings do change depending on whether I have a 9:00 a.m. class or not.
我的早晨确实会有变化，取决于当天是不是九点有课。

38
00:03:18,400 --> 00:03:22,280
Um, but this is my routine for when I do have early classes.
嗯，不过这就是我有早课时的日常安排。
